        inline:
            ```css
            p{
                font-family: "Arial", serif;
                font-weight: bold;
                font-size:11.5px;
                color:#3f46bb;
            }
            
            .cambio{
                vertical-align: middle;
                border-style: dashed;
                border-width: thin;
                border-color: #afa9a9;
                background-color:#eeeeee;
                pointer-events: none;
            }
            ```
